-- 3. Lift — The hoist tries to lift the crate and stalls. Chain, motor, a
-- bounce. The bass takes the work song low and slow.
-- ~40 cycles (~109 s at 88 BPM).

glideBpm 88 16
-- the gate falls away; the hoist is the new pulse
fadeSilence 12 [2,3,4]
d1 $ stack [bootWork, liftStall]
xfadeIn 6 16 bassLift

-- chain and crate
xfadeIn 9 16 $ stack [liftChain, crateScrape]
-- the motor surges
xfadeIn 3 16 motor
-- the high shadow of the hook
xfadeIn 5 24 colourLift
-- the reed hears the strain
xfadeIn 7 24 reedLift

xfadeIn 4 16 compLift
-- one high spark from the top of the lift
xfadeIn 8 32 trumpetSpark

-- the hoist gives up; the bass states the work song
xfadeIn 6 16 motifBass
